------- FILE main.asm
------- FILE sounds.asm LEVEL 2 PASS 3
      0  31d5					      include	"sounds.asm"
      1  31d5							; Fat Chip 64 - sounds (V), mono (C), Fat Bass, SID effects
      2  31d5							;
      3  31d5							; Each sound is a column in soundtab.asm (made by tools/gen_sounds.py): the
      4  31d5							; SID's envelope, wave, width, filter, detune and effects; the Game Boy's
      5  31d5							; parameters (sent once as CCs: it does its own LFOs and warble); the
      6  31d5							; MidiNES's duty and envelope (CC7, nesenv.asm). FAT, PADS and RAW are
      7  31d5							; v0.11's; the rest are demo versions of the Chip Lab sounds.
      8  31d5							;
      9  31d5							; Each sound has a mono default and a Fat Bass default:
     10  31d5							;   MONO      one note (the last key pressed and still held) on every voice;
     11  31d5							;	       a new key while another is held changes the pitch without a
     12  31d5							;	       new attack (legato; the Game Boy glides if the sound has glide)
     13  31d5							;   FAT BASS  the Game Boy wave and the NES triangle play the lowest note,
     14  31d5							;	       folded by octaves into E1-E2 (BASS_LO-BASS_HI); off, they join
     15  31d5							;	       the other voices
     16  31d5							;
     17  31d5							; SID effects, every 4 ms (FxTick): filter LFO and envelope, pulse-width LFO
     18  31d5							; (each voice its own phase), vibrato (all voices in step unless the sound
     19  31d5							; spreads them), glide; and the duty sequence (SID width steps, NES CC1).
     20  31d5
     21  31d5							; ------------------------------------------------------------ choosing
     22  31d5							; V: next sound (SHIFT+V: previous)
     23  31d5				   SoundKey
     24  31d5					      subroutine
